  "classification_reason": "Meets the 111.462 ms target in every parity-valid configuration on development hardware (best 81.69 ms). Not A because no Edge hardware exists to verify compatibility with the actual target, and this sprint demonstrated within its own scope how badly an uncontrolled measurement environment can mislead.",
  "measurement_class": "development",
  "is_edge_target": false,
  "headline_correction": {
    "what": "Sprint 22's RT-DETR benchmark does not reproduce",
    "sprint22_published_mean_ms": 473.42,
