      "why_rejected": "max abs output delta 0.9875 against FP32 \u2014 the Neural Engine and GPU paths compute in FP16. Guardian's export gate rejects at 1e-4 and Sprint 23 \u00a712 forbids changing confidence semantics. 2.4x faster and a different answer; on a detector that means a detection appearing or disappearing.",
      "must_not_be_quoted_as_rtdetr_latency": true
    }
  ],
  "thread_finding": {
    "dominant_lever": "intra_op_threads",
    "ordering_best_to_worst": [
      "intra=8: 96.54",
      "intra=2: 103.77",
      "default: 113.32",
      "intra=4: 128.32"
    ],
    "monotonic": false,
    "note": "intra=4 is reproducibly worst across every optimization level, which points at this host's hybrid core layout (4 threads landing partly on efficiency cores) rather than at the model. It will not transfer to a homogeneous Edge CPU."
